      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "A press you feed by hand is a hobby. A press fed by item pipes is a factory. Run a pipe from a chest of parts to the press and another from its output to a second chest, with conveyor covers on the pipe ends to do the pulling. The press has room for six inputs and three outputs.\n\nLet the line run until it has made sixteen loaded pistol magazines. That is four filling runs, and it is the sort of job you do not want to babysit. The pack\u0027s Basic Transport: Items quest covers the pipe basics.\n\n[note]Pull rounds and empties from separate chests so a full output cannot starve the inputs.[/note]",
